---
title: Getting started
pageSlug: getting-started
mod: spell-actionbar
section: getting-started
order: 1
---

Install **NeoForge** for Minecraft 1.21.1, then drop Spell Actionbar in your `mods` folder with [Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks) and Iron’s Lib.

1. Open a world and press the Spell Actionbar key (default `` ` ``) to open the equip screen.
2. Place Iron’s **scrolls** into free actionbar slots.
3. Cast with Iron’s **quick-cast** keybinds — the HUD shows the bound key on each slot.
4. Scrolls are **not consumed** when casting from the bar.

If you also run [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex), that addon takes over discovery and unlocks. You will equip Codex spells onto this same bar instead of loose scrolls. Codex needs Actionbar **1.1.4 or newer**.
